!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = scRNAseq + scV(D)J
!Sample_description = A1
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina RTA3 method for base-calling
!Sample_data_processing = 10xGenomics cellranger pipeline for alignment and filtering (trimming 5' TSO sequence and 3' polyA tail, alignment with STAR, UMI counting, EmptyDrops method for empty droplet removal)
!Sample_data_processing = SoupX background contamination removal (CD14, CD68, CD16, and MS4A7 were used to estimate contamination fraction and counts were adjusted using SoupX::adjustCounts function)
!Sample_data_processing = DoubletFinder doublet removal (doublet formation rate of 1% based on 10xGenomics multiplet rate estimation, using 12 PCs and pN = 0.25)
!Sample_data_processing = Seurat filtering and normalization (filter out cells with >10% mitochondrial reads, retain cells with at least 200 mapped features, retain features with at least 3 mapped cells, counts were then normalized using Seurat's LogNormalize method)
!Sample_data_processing = Assembly: hg38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: matrix table of raw gene counts for each gene and cell barcode
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary files format and content: matrix table log-normalized expression values for each gene and cell barcode
